WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.160 --> 01:37.360
=Episode 14=

01:38.500 --> 01:40.313
(Bandit Camp)

01:40.407 --> 01:41.368
Come. Drink!

01:41.368 --> 01:41.847
Come on.

01:41.847 --> 01:42.968
Drink up.

01:47.008 --> 01:47.487
Hurry up!

01:51.767 --> 01:52.648
Zhao.

01:53.287 --> 01:54.847
I let you go last time.

01:55.248 --> 01:56.847
And you actually dare to come back?

01:58.287 --> 01:59.207
You've got a death wish.

01:59.207 --> 02:00.968
Precisely because you let me go,

02:01.888 --> 02:03.407
I'm here to return the favor.

02:06.327 --> 02:07.808
Do you know Lu Dahu?

02:18.968 --> 02:20.768
That scoundrel Lu Dahu.

02:21.287 --> 02:22.847
Commander Wang trusted him so much.

02:24.607 --> 02:26.007
But he messed up the job.

02:26.007 --> 02:26.768
Someone found out.

02:28.727 --> 02:29.687
What did he mess up?

02:44.127 --> 02:45.007
What have you

02:45.127 --> 02:46.167
found out this time?

02:47.127 --> 02:49.048
Killing civilians
to claim military merit.

02:49.887 --> 02:51.208
That's a grave crime.

02:54.528 --> 02:56.127
That's a crime punishable by death.

03:02.048 --> 03:02.928
Zhao.

03:05.088 --> 03:06.208
What does Lu Dahu have

03:06.208 --> 03:07.847
to do with me?

03:09.847 --> 03:11.928
Why are you causing trouble on my turf?

03:12.648 --> 03:13.167
Guards.

03:15.287 --> 03:16.287
Drag him out

03:17.248 --> 03:17.808
and execute him.

03:19.607 --> 03:21.167
Then Mr. Tuo, who will you

03:21.167 --> 03:22.648
do business with from now on?

03:26.687 --> 03:28.928
Now I'm Commander Wang's trusted man.

03:39.447 --> 03:40.968
What I just said

03:41.887 --> 03:43.687
is also what he is worried about.

03:44.167 --> 03:44.928
Lu Dahu

03:44.928 --> 03:46.528
is definitely not getting out.

03:47.488 --> 03:48.528
From now on,

03:50.928 --> 03:52.048
I'm in charge.

04:04.607 --> 04:05.847
Then does Commander Wang

04:06.928 --> 04:08.607
have any new instructions?

04:14.328 --> 04:15.488
Business stays as usual.

04:17.167 --> 04:19.247
I don't care how much
Lu Dahu used to give you.

04:19.727 --> 04:21.888
I'll give you thirty copper coins
per tael.

04:23.287 --> 04:25.088
That's higher than the market price.

04:26.088 --> 04:26.927
Brother,

04:27.888 --> 04:29.247
I told you before.

04:29.768 --> 04:31.128
We're bound by fate.

04:31.528 --> 04:32.287
Being fated isn't enough.

04:34.487 --> 04:35.407
What about the profit?

04:36.528 --> 04:37.088
Tell me.

04:37.407 --> 04:38.287
How much do you want to take?

04:44.528 --> 04:45.968
You just need to tell me

04:48.367 --> 04:49.208
where those warhorses

04:50.448 --> 04:51.128
came from.

04:53.487 --> 04:54.448
What warhorses?

04:56.607 --> 04:58.328
These are just ordinary mounts.

04:58.328 --> 04:59.487
Nothing worth mentioning.

05:00.648 --> 05:02.648
How could I possibly have warhorses?

05:19.367 --> 05:20.528
Take a look at the goods yourself.

05:20.927 --> 05:21.847
When it comes to business,

05:22.648 --> 05:24.167
you're not my only option.

05:30.487 --> 05:31.367
On the fifth of every month,

05:31.968 --> 05:33.448
at the mining site
15 kilometers north of here,

05:35.287 --> 05:36.208
the Wangur people

05:37.287 --> 05:38.688
are in urgent need of iron for weapons.

05:40.688 --> 05:41.367
They trade

05:42.888 --> 05:43.688
secretly with foreign merchants.

05:46.648 --> 05:48.247
This whole thing with Zhao

05:48.367 --> 05:50.128
is getting more and more absurd.

05:50.568 --> 05:51.847
Back in Linchun Town,

05:51.847 --> 05:53.287
when we crossed swords with him,

05:53.287 --> 05:54.768
he didn't even flinch.

05:54.768 --> 05:56.568
There's no way he'd flee from battle.

05:59.927 --> 06:00.648
Listen.

06:02.607 --> 06:04.047
Go and see Miss Xie.

06:04.047 --> 06:04.847
Tell her

06:04.847 --> 06:05.568
that we've already

06:05.568 --> 06:07.487
sent cavalry to search for him.

06:07.487 --> 06:08.448
Set her mind at ease.

06:08.648 --> 06:09.927
Rest assured, General.

06:10.008 --> 06:12.128
What concerns you concerns me.

06:12.367 --> 06:13.528
Even if you hadn't said a word,

06:13.927 --> 06:15.167
I would have done the same.

06:19.568 --> 06:21.528
You're always so understanding.

06:30.607 --> 06:31.407
Miss, wait.

06:36.008 --> 06:36.487
Miss,

06:37.247 --> 06:38.167
you dropped something.

06:40.568 --> 06:42.047
My young lady doesn't own such a thing.

06:42.688 --> 06:44.047
It must belong to some other lady.

06:44.247 --> 06:45.208
Go find its owner elsewhere.

06:46.088 --> 06:46.568
Miss,

06:46.807 --> 06:47.367
let's go.

06:48.528 --> 06:49.047
Miss!

06:49.727 --> 06:50.807
Such a lecher.

06:51.128 --> 06:52.688
What a waste
of a deputy battalion commander title.

06:53.247 --> 06:55.088
The small fry are harder to deal with.

06:55.088 --> 06:56.088
Just steer clear of him.

06:57.208 --> 06:57.888
No matter.

06:59.047 --> 07:00.047
Haste

07:00.047 --> 07:01.247
makes waste.

07:02.008 --> 07:03.287
Her man has already run off.

07:04.088 --> 07:05.047
She should be

07:05.047 --> 07:06.088
easy to handle.

07:06.407 --> 07:07.568
Leave it to me.

07:09.407 --> 07:11.167
Even Commander Lu,
who went with him, is back.

07:11.448 --> 07:12.968
Why hasn't he returned yet?

07:12.968 --> 07:14.208
Mr. Zhao isn't back yet?

07:15.208 --> 07:16.528
What if something happened to him?

07:17.407 --> 07:18.528
All you do is ask questions.

07:18.807 --> 07:20.247
Go to the garrison and find out.

07:26.847 --> 07:28.688
I shouldn't have been so stubborn
with Mr. Zhao.

07:35.528 --> 07:37.328
Here in Ganlin Town,

07:38.128 --> 07:39.528
people die every day.

07:40.607 --> 07:41.727
The men,

07:41.727 --> 07:42.927
all desperate to earn merit,

07:43.448 --> 07:45.568
will fight tooth and nail
to get to the battlefield.

07:45.768 --> 07:47.047
But what about us women?

07:47.847 --> 07:49.688
We don't care about any of this.

07:50.487 --> 07:51.367
All we want

07:52.287 --> 07:54.807
is someone who truly cares for us.

07:54.968 --> 07:55.607
Right?

07:56.528 --> 07:58.287
What news do you have?

07:58.688 --> 07:59.768
Just tell me.

08:01.247 --> 08:03.047
You poor thing.

08:03.768 --> 08:05.287
Banner Commander Zhao

08:06.407 --> 08:07.167
is gone.

08:07.847 --> 08:09.088
You can't just say things like that.

08:09.487 --> 08:10.487
Without any proof,

08:10.927 --> 08:12.128
how can you be so sure?

08:12.768 --> 08:14.448
My brother saw it with his own eyes.

08:15.128 --> 08:16.008
Last night,

08:16.487 --> 08:18.287
General Mo also received
the official notice.

08:19.047 --> 08:20.727
It's just that the public announcement

08:20.727 --> 08:22.047
won't come for a few more days.

08:23.088 --> 08:24.287
Honestly, I shouldn't be

08:24.648 --> 08:26.287
the one telling you this.

08:27.968 --> 08:28.648
But

08:28.968 --> 08:31.047
I figured if things come to that,

08:31.047 --> 08:32.607
you need to have a plan, right?

08:33.767 --> 08:34.847
As women,

08:35.168 --> 08:36.968
we have to plan

08:37.127 --> 08:38.088
for our future,

08:38.088 --> 08:38.727
right?

08:47.968 --> 08:49.328
I've been thinking

08:50.847 --> 08:52.007
that my younger brother

08:52.767 --> 08:54.367
is a deputy battalion commander.

08:55.367 --> 08:57.688
He's a considerate man too.

08:59.448 --> 09:00.487
So that's

09:01.127 --> 09:02.568
what you've been scheming all along.

09:03.527 --> 09:05.288
It's all for your own good.

09:05.727 --> 09:06.607
In Ganlin Town,

09:06.727 --> 09:08.408
there are
no fewer than seven or eight known gangs

09:08.408 --> 09:09.487
of idle thugs

09:09.887 --> 09:12.088
who target unprotected families.

09:12.328 --> 09:13.487
At night,

09:13.487 --> 09:14.487
they break down doors,

09:14.487 --> 09:16.208
beat people unconscious,

09:16.208 --> 09:17.367
stuff them in sacks,

09:17.367 --> 09:18.568
and sell them to pleasure houses
and gambling dens.

09:18.647 --> 09:19.408
Or

09:19.408 --> 09:20.688
to the barbarians beyond the pass.

09:21.088 --> 09:21.487
You...

09:23.408 --> 09:24.127
By regulation,

09:25.088 --> 09:26.367
any officer under orders

09:27.127 --> 09:28.607
who abandons his post

09:29.007 --> 09:30.127
must be reported by his superior

09:30.647 --> 09:32.048
and confirmed by the Regional Commander.

09:32.127 --> 09:33.048
Only then is it final.

09:35.247 --> 09:37.168
Right now, Mr. Zhao is still away
on campaign.

09:37.408 --> 09:38.727
And yet you come to pressure me,

09:39.367 --> 09:41.007
to trick
and seduce a fellow officer's wife.

09:41.847 --> 09:43.328
That deserves military punishment.

09:48.048 --> 09:49.647
Don't bother trying to scare me.

09:50.808 --> 09:52.127
Your man is gone,

09:52.127 --> 09:52.808
plain and simple.

09:53.328 --> 09:54.288
Serving one man

09:54.448 --> 09:55.968
is better than serving a whole pack.

10:03.328 --> 10:04.127
Miss Xie.

10:04.367 --> 10:05.247
We meet again.

10:09.487 --> 10:10.448
Men and women
should keep their distance.

10:10.568 --> 10:11.647
Commander Lu,
please show some restraint.

10:14.688 --> 10:15.887
Don't rush off.

10:17.168 --> 10:18.408
With this floral hair ornament on,

10:18.408 --> 10:18.808
you'd look beautiful.

10:18.808 --> 10:20.487
You shameless wretch!

10:20.647 --> 10:21.088
Yi.

10:21.088 --> 10:22.487
Zhao Ling is out fighting,

10:22.607 --> 10:24.607
and you're here seducing his fiancee!

10:24.607 --> 10:24.887
General, please calm down!

10:24.887 --> 10:26.568
I'll beat you, you sneaky scoundrel!

10:26.568 --> 10:27.487
I'll kick you to death!

10:27.487 --> 10:28.767
I'll hit you every time I see you!

10:28.767 --> 10:29.847
When did you get here?

10:29.847 --> 10:30.767
Why didn't you tell me?

10:30.767 --> 10:31.727
Why are you protecting him?

10:31.727 --> 10:33.247
Why don't you keep
your good-for-nothing brother in line?

10:33.328 --> 10:35.448
Calm down.

10:35.767 --> 10:36.367
Calm down.

10:38.847 --> 10:39.647
Miss Xie,

10:39.727 --> 10:40.968
I'm truly sorry.

10:41.527 --> 10:42.408
But rest assured,

10:42.408 --> 10:43.767
that wretched scoundrel

10:43.928 --> 10:45.448
will never come to bother you again.

10:46.288 --> 10:47.487
Thank you, General Mo.

10:48.527 --> 10:49.408
General,

10:49.408 --> 10:50.968
have you truly received word
of Mr. Zhao?

10:51.408 --> 10:52.847
I've already sent men to look for him.

10:53.127 --> 10:53.928
As soon as there's news,

10:53.928 --> 10:55.408
I'll have someone come and tell you.

10:56.048 --> 10:56.968
Didn't Concubine Lu

10:57.048 --> 10:57.928
tell you?

11:04.688 --> 11:05.968
What she said

11:06.808 --> 11:08.168
and what you said

11:08.168 --> 11:09.168
are not quite the same.

11:11.527 --> 11:13.048
Please forgive me, General.

11:13.727 --> 11:14.487
From now on,

11:14.968 --> 11:16.448
please don't send her to see me anymore.

11:16.887 --> 11:18.448
If she keeps coming to press me,

11:18.607 --> 11:19.568
day after day,

11:19.568 --> 11:21.208
it will only breed ill feelings.

11:22.688 --> 11:23.607
Has she been

11:23.887 --> 11:24.727
making things hard for you?

11:25.527 --> 11:26.968
She tried to arrange for her brother

11:27.968 --> 11:29.328
to marry my young lady.

11:29.527 --> 11:30.408
What?

11:32.328 --> 11:33.607
It's all my fault.

11:33.847 --> 11:36.007
It must have been something I said

11:37.887 --> 11:40.727
that made Miss Xie misunderstand.

11:42.568 --> 11:43.527
General,

11:44.408 --> 11:47.127
I've been with you
since I was seventeen.

11:48.968 --> 11:51.048
After all these years of devotion,

11:51.808 --> 11:54.168
don't you trust me?

12:00.168 --> 12:00.647
Come here.

12:00.647 --> 12:01.208
Get up.

12:04.727 --> 12:06.408
What I said today was harsh.

12:06.887 --> 12:07.607
But

12:08.288 --> 12:10.127
you need to take it to heart.

12:15.487 --> 12:16.527
Then, General,

12:17.448 --> 12:19.367
won't you stay the night?

12:21.847 --> 12:22.727
No.

12:23.408 --> 12:24.847
You know how things are

12:25.088 --> 12:26.328
at home.

12:37.367 --> 12:38.887
That scheming wretch.

12:39.448 --> 12:40.887
Who does she think she is?

12:41.487 --> 12:43.767
How dare she speak ill of me
to the General?

12:47.968 --> 12:48.968
Once that Zhao

12:48.968 --> 12:50.568
is confirmed as a deserter,

12:51.328 --> 12:52.568
I'll wait to see her cry.

12:52.568 --> 12:53.968
Even if he doesn't die today,

12:54.208 --> 12:55.568
he'll die tomorrow.

12:55.647 --> 12:56.527
I'll curse him

12:56.527 --> 12:58.448
to death!

13:28.127 --> 13:29.088
General...

13:29.487 --> 13:30.127
General...

13:31.328 --> 13:33.127
I think I just lost my mind.

13:33.448 --> 13:33.808
I...

13:34.288 --> 13:35.088
I don't know

13:35.088 --> 13:37.688
what came over me today.

13:38.367 --> 13:38.968
I...

13:39.928 --> 13:40.487
I...

13:40.487 --> 13:40.968
I...

13:41.647 --> 13:42.048
I...

13:42.127 --> 13:42.968
General...

13:42.968 --> 13:43.688
I...

13:44.607 --> 13:45.168
I...

14:03.208 --> 14:03.647
Here.

14:03.928 --> 14:04.808
Eat some more.

14:10.247 --> 14:10.767
Father,

14:11.127 --> 14:11.847
have some.

14:14.288 --> 14:14.727
Eat.

14:20.247 --> 14:20.727
Dig in.

14:20.727 --> 14:23.007
Why does Father look so distracted?

14:23.887 --> 14:24.727
Him?

14:25.247 --> 14:26.127
His heart's in pieces.

14:26.968 --> 14:27.808
Quick, pick them up

14:28.288 --> 14:29.647
and put your father back together.

14:33.328 --> 14:34.208
What are you staring at?

14:34.288 --> 14:35.007
Eat your meal

14:35.088 --> 14:35.847
and don't take after your father.

14:38.688 --> 14:39.328
You too.

14:39.568 --> 14:40.208
Eat first.

14:45.088 --> 14:45.647
Move over.

14:58.048 --> 14:59.127
Why are you giving me money?

14:59.288 --> 15:00.127
They say

15:00.127 --> 15:01.127
when love fails,

15:01.127 --> 15:02.007
luck in gambling prevails.

15:02.527 --> 15:03.568
Take it out

15:03.568 --> 15:04.448
and win some back.

15:04.727 --> 15:05.767
That way you'll be of some use.

15:06.247 --> 15:07.288
Why are you...?

15:38.168 --> 15:38.887
Miss Xie!

15:38.968 --> 15:40.408
There's news of Mr. Zhao!

15:40.408 --> 15:41.607
Chuan is back.

15:41.767 --> 15:42.408
Miss Xie,

15:42.408 --> 15:43.208
Chuan is back!

15:43.208 --> 15:43.968
Where is Mr. Zhao?

15:44.487 --> 15:46.208
Mr. Zhao took the brothers
to capture warhorses.

15:46.328 --> 15:47.208
He sent me back

15:47.208 --> 15:47.928
to bring reinforcements.

15:48.127 --> 15:48.928
He'll be back in a few days.

15:49.288 --> 15:50.288
He was worried you might be anxious,

15:50.288 --> 15:51.247
so he sent me to tell you.

15:51.727 --> 15:52.767
They went out to prepare for battle.

15:53.007 --> 15:53.928
Everything was going fine,

15:53.928 --> 15:54.928
so why the sudden change of plan?

15:54.928 --> 15:56.127
It's all that Lu Dahu's fault.

15:56.847 --> 15:58.448
Not only did he trip us up,

15:58.928 --> 15:59.487
but he also

15:59.487 --> 16:00.288
killed civilians and claimed credit.

16:00.367 --> 16:01.568
He wanted our heads.

16:02.247 --> 16:03.487
He's absolute trash.

16:04.247 --> 16:04.688
So

16:04.688 --> 16:05.808
are you all alright?

16:06.328 --> 16:07.367
We just got humiliated.

16:07.688 --> 16:08.367
Don't worry.

16:08.647 --> 16:09.727
We'll take those warhorses

16:09.808 --> 16:10.928
and won't come back empty-handed.

16:12.168 --> 16:13.208
Shameless wretch!

16:14.328 --> 16:15.808
I thought Lu Dahu

16:16.007 --> 16:17.328
was just a shameless lecher.

16:17.487 --> 16:18.847
I figured I could just stay
out of his way.

16:19.527 --> 16:20.367
Who would've thought

16:20.847 --> 16:23.048
he'd do something this vile,

16:23.208 --> 16:24.448
and even make
Mr. Zhao's life miserable?

16:28.208 --> 16:29.448
You go help Mr. Zhao first.

16:29.647 --> 16:30.607
He needs you more.

16:30.968 --> 16:31.847
But Miss Xie...

16:32.448 --> 16:32.968
Don't worry.

16:33.288 --> 16:33.887
I'm here.

16:34.727 --> 16:35.448
And me.

16:37.808 --> 16:38.968
A monster like that

16:39.767 --> 16:41.168
isn't worth dirtying our hands over.

16:46.127 --> 16:46.727
Miss Xie.

17:00.367 --> 17:01.367
The other day,

17:01.688 --> 17:03.448
I was rude to reject your kindness.

17:04.087 --> 17:05.968
I have let your goodwill go to waste.

17:06.848 --> 17:08.408
With Banner Commander Zhao gone,

17:08.888 --> 17:09.968
I must find

17:10.408 --> 17:12.208
someone to lean on.

17:12.648 --> 17:13.848
If you are willing,

17:14.287 --> 17:15.487
the Lu family will always welcome you.

17:16.168 --> 17:17.247
I will be home

17:18.727 --> 17:20.047
alone tonight.

17:37.208 --> 17:38.128
My dear.

17:42.968 --> 17:44.047
My dear.

17:57.727 --> 17:59.047
I didn't expect you

17:59.047 --> 18:00.368
to be even more eager than I am.

18:01.287 --> 18:02.527
Already in bed.

18:07.327 --> 18:08.448
I brought you

18:08.448 --> 18:09.448
some fine wine.

18:10.727 --> 18:12.608
I had hoped
we could share a drink or two,

18:13.047 --> 18:14.128
to lift the spirits.

18:56.327 --> 18:57.168
Back then,

18:57.327 --> 18:58.968
I met Sanniang by chance

18:58.968 --> 19:00.247
through a twist of fate.

19:00.487 --> 19:02.168
If it weren't for Sanniang,

19:02.848 --> 19:03.527
then...

19:04.247 --> 19:04.888
Right.

19:04.888 --> 19:06.928
It was Miss Xie who saved me first.

19:06.928 --> 19:08.247
And then I saved her.

19:08.247 --> 19:08.888
Shall we

19:09.007 --> 19:10.408
call it a day?

19:10.408 --> 19:11.567
It's late and chilly.

19:11.567 --> 19:13.128
We should get some rest.

19:15.567 --> 19:16.168
Madam.

19:16.368 --> 19:17.047
Something's wrong.

19:17.047 --> 19:17.848
There's trouble!

19:20.368 --> 19:20.888
Madam,

19:21.327 --> 19:22.688
Lu Dahu was bitten by dogs.

19:23.287 --> 19:24.047
Dogs?

19:27.968 --> 19:29.007
Where did it happen?

19:29.007 --> 19:30.168
At your place.

19:31.767 --> 19:33.247
Please seek justice for me, Madam.

19:34.928 --> 19:35.527
Dahu,

19:35.968 --> 19:37.047
are you alright?

19:37.047 --> 19:38.007
Everyone, leave now.

19:38.408 --> 19:39.767
He's just a scoundrel.

19:39.928 --> 19:41.087
Nothing worth seeing.

19:45.086 --> 19:46.186
(Zhao Residence)

19:46.208 --> 19:47.888
Please seek justice for me, Madam.

19:49.648 --> 19:52.208
My brother was not bitten by accident.

19:54.047 --> 19:54.888
It was her.

19:56.807 --> 19:58.448
You cruel wretch.

19:58.968 --> 20:00.168
If you weren't willing,

20:00.688 --> 20:02.007
you could have just rejected.

20:02.007 --> 20:03.727
Why did you set the dogs on my brother?

20:03.727 --> 20:04.848
Don't listen to her, everyone.

20:07.487 --> 20:09.408
My dogs only know
how to guard the house.

20:09.968 --> 20:10.807
If your brother hadn't

20:10.807 --> 20:12.327
come out of nowhere,

20:12.448 --> 20:13.848
how would he have been bitten?

20:13.848 --> 20:14.807
That's right.

20:14.807 --> 20:16.208
I beg you to investigate, Madam.

20:16.368 --> 20:18.688
My brother
is a deputy battalion commander.

20:19.208 --> 20:20.688
A junior fifth-rank official.

20:21.527 --> 20:22.448
This cannot be

20:22.448 --> 20:24.047
left unresolved.

20:24.047 --> 20:25.047
Madam Wang,

20:25.448 --> 20:27.007
I beg you.

20:28.567 --> 20:29.888
If you cannot

20:29.888 --> 20:31.287
deliver justice for us today,

20:32.087 --> 20:33.567
I will beat the Dengwen Drum

20:33.567 --> 20:35.168
and demand an answer!

20:35.327 --> 20:35.767
Right.

20:36.527 --> 20:38.688
Look what they did to my brother!

20:40.727 --> 20:41.688
Yes, beat the drum.

20:41.688 --> 20:42.527
Beat the drum.

20:42.527 --> 20:44.688
Look what it did to my brother.

20:46.763 --> 20:49.610
(Abandoned Wangur Mine)

20:49.928 --> 20:51.007
The silver notes are all here.

20:54.448 --> 20:55.007
How is it?

20:55.208 --> 20:55.928
Not bad.

20:56.807 --> 20:58.928
Our cooperation
will keep getting better.

20:59.848 --> 21:00.688
Of course.

21:04.168 --> 21:05.567
You go count the goods.

21:06.287 --> 21:06.727
Go.

21:33.247 --> 21:33.888
Brothers,

21:34.648 --> 21:35.448
capture the warhorses!

21:54.247 --> 21:55.807
We've got so many warhorses this time.

21:55.888 --> 21:57.047
Our military merits are sealed.

21:57.448 --> 21:58.047
Right.

21:58.247 --> 21:59.247
I'd like to see what Lu Dahu

21:59.247 --> 22:00.567
has to say now.

22:05.390 --> 22:09.015
♪I lift a cup of humble wine
to the passing breeze♪

22:09.047 --> 22:09.648
Follow me.

22:11.362 --> 22:16.557
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a ballad♪

22:20.550 --> 22:26.303
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a song♪

22:27.487 --> 22:28.128
Company Commander Zhao.

22:28.128 --> 22:29.168
It seems something has happened
at your home.

22:30.688 --> 22:32.168
You go report to Commander Wang
about the warhorses.

22:32.408 --> 22:33.247
I'll find him later.

22:33.608 --> 22:33.968
Alright.

22:44.527 --> 22:45.287
How is he?

22:47.208 --> 22:48.928
Commander Lu's tendons are all torn.

22:48.928 --> 22:49.688
I'm afraid...

22:52.807 --> 22:53.807
Afraid of what?

22:55.128 --> 22:56.888
I'm afraid he'll be crippled for life.

22:56.888 --> 22:58.047
You're lying!

22:59.608 --> 23:00.007
Sister!

23:00.128 --> 23:00.727
Sister!

23:01.128 --> 23:02.168
It's alright.

23:02.608 --> 23:04.408
I didn't...

23:04.408 --> 23:05.487
It's alright.

23:05.487 --> 23:06.247
I didn't...

23:06.247 --> 23:07.767
It's alright.

23:11.688 --> 23:13.208
Madam Wang.

23:14.527 --> 23:15.527
Madam Wang.

23:16.608 --> 23:19.208
Ever since my brother could walk,

23:19.208 --> 23:20.527
he could wield a blade.

23:21.567 --> 23:24.247
He hasn't even made his name yet.

23:25.047 --> 23:25.848
Commander Lu.

23:25.928 --> 23:28.527
Look at what he's been reduced to!

23:29.007 --> 23:30.247
Madam Wang,

23:30.448 --> 23:33.287
you must deliver justice for us today!

23:33.487 --> 23:35.007
Madam Wang!

23:35.007 --> 23:36.767
After all, your dogs hurt him.

23:37.368 --> 23:38.928
What do you propose to make amends?

23:41.287 --> 23:42.287
Please ask the healer

23:42.448 --> 23:43.968
to prescribe the best medicine.

23:44.448 --> 23:45.408
Whatever it costs,

23:45.408 --> 23:46.448
use the most effective remedies.

23:46.767 --> 23:47.527
I'll cover

23:47.767 --> 23:48.408
all the expenses.

23:49.408 --> 23:50.168
Miss Xie.

23:51.567 --> 23:53.368
He was the one who did wrong first.

23:55.007 --> 23:56.688
Shut up!

23:58.327 --> 24:00.888
My brother is now crippled.

24:01.327 --> 24:04.368
Can a mere dose of medicine fix that?

24:04.888 --> 24:06.487
So none of you are willing
to take responsibility?

24:06.807 --> 24:07.567
Fine.

24:07.688 --> 24:09.007
I'll take this to the authorities!

24:09.727 --> 24:11.408
Careful, Commander Lu!

24:11.408 --> 24:12.128
Dahu.

24:12.448 --> 24:13.727
Xie!

24:14.087 --> 24:16.688
Xie!

24:17.527 --> 24:18.368
Dahu.

24:18.487 --> 24:18.888
Madam Wang.

24:18.888 --> 24:19.408
Enough!

24:20.527 --> 24:22.128
Do you have to shout?

24:22.327 --> 24:23.327
What do you propose?

24:25.487 --> 24:26.888
Xie,

24:28.087 --> 24:29.968
I'll make you pay for this!

24:30.487 --> 24:33.047
You have to marry him

24:33.527 --> 24:34.888
right this second!

24:34.888 --> 24:35.727
In your dreams!

24:36.648 --> 24:38.247
My dogs only bite scoundrels.

24:38.487 --> 24:39.527
He ended up like this

24:39.527 --> 24:40.888
because he had it coming!

24:40.888 --> 24:42.487
You're talking nonsense!

24:43.087 --> 24:44.247
Move!

25:43.327 --> 25:44.527
Zhao Ling!

25:47.608 --> 25:47.968
Zhao...

25:47.968 --> 25:48.247
Zhao...

25:48.247 --> 25:48.848
Zhao Ling.

25:49.408 --> 25:50.208
What are you doing?

26:20.368 --> 26:22.327
I'm sorry, Zhao Ling.

26:22.408 --> 26:23.648
I know I was wrong.

26:31.247 --> 26:31.848
Zhao Ling.

26:31.848 --> 26:33.448
Please don't kill me!

26:33.567 --> 26:34.928
Please don't kill me!

26:35.128 --> 26:36.688
Please! I'm begging you!

26:40.247 --> 26:41.567
Lu Dahu,

26:45.527 --> 26:47.168
you scumbag!

26:47.848 --> 26:49.287
No!

27:13.487 --> 27:14.727
I killed him.

27:15.727 --> 27:17.128
Miss Xie had nothing to do with it.

27:17.888 --> 27:19.128
But as for why Lu Dahu

27:19.128 --> 27:20.968
set his sights on Miss Xie
time and again,

27:21.128 --> 27:22.327
you owe me an explanation.

27:23.208 --> 27:24.208
I just

27:25.007 --> 27:25.487
wanted

27:25.567 --> 27:26.807
to find my brother

27:26.807 --> 27:27.327
someone

27:27.408 --> 27:28.888
to care for him.

27:29.608 --> 27:31.247
Who put you up to this?

27:34.767 --> 27:36.047
Could it be

27:39.128 --> 27:41.168
that Zuo is involved too?

27:46.648 --> 27:48.128
So she was behind it all along.

27:56.087 --> 27:56.767
Madam Wang.

27:57.408 --> 27:58.087
I'm sorry to have disturbed you.

28:23.433 --> 28:28.780
♪Once a bird in a cage,
longing for the boundless sky♪

28:29.860 --> 28:35.353
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

28:36.306 --> 28:38.437
♪Bearing wings through stormy tides♪

28:38.487 --> 28:39.087
Don't look.

28:39.143 --> 28:42.279
♪Wash away the stain
of every false accusation♪

28:42.755 --> 28:48.128
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

28:49.034 --> 28:54.496
♪Let this humble name carry me
through a life adrift♪

28:54.527 --> 28:55.327
I'm back.

28:55.609 --> 29:00.873
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

29:01.568 --> 29:04.296
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

29:04.339 --> 29:08.645
♪Trade it for boundless blue skies
to fly free and far♪

29:09.038 --> 29:14.039
♪I seek no mercy lent by mortal world♪

29:15.561 --> 29:19.120
♪This mortal world♪

29:20.936 --> 29:26.480
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

29:27.303 --> 29:31.900
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

29:33.456 --> 29:35.989
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

29:36.243 --> 29:41.121
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

29:41.329 --> 29:48.050
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

29:52.567 --> 29:53.567
Company Commander Zhao.

29:54.408 --> 29:55.608
Where did you get

29:55.608 --> 29:57.408
these warhorses?

29:57.848 --> 29:59.567
Some foreign merchants colluded
with the Wangur people.

30:01.448 --> 30:02.688
Someone tipped me off.

30:03.448 --> 30:04.287
I seized them.

30:04.487 --> 30:06.128
Who told you?

30:06.287 --> 30:07.368
Someone with the means

30:07.368 --> 30:08.928
to trade salt in Ganlin Town.

30:16.928 --> 30:18.247
Military regulations state

30:19.287 --> 30:20.968
that for every ten warhorses seized,

30:20.968 --> 30:23.087
one level of merit is granted.

30:23.648 --> 30:24.368
This time,

30:24.448 --> 30:26.247
you could have earned significant merit.

30:27.168 --> 30:28.408
But Lu Dahu,

30:28.408 --> 30:30.128
after all,
was a deputy battalion commander.

30:30.208 --> 30:31.648
He held an important post.

30:32.727 --> 30:33.928
You killed him.

30:34.327 --> 30:36.047
That is a heavy offense.

30:36.608 --> 30:37.727
Before I joined the garrison,

30:37.727 --> 30:38.848
I too traded in salt.

30:39.767 --> 30:41.448
I've dealt with all kinds of people.

30:41.688 --> 30:42.767
Whatever Lu Dahu could do,

30:42.767 --> 30:43.688
I can do too.

30:44.527 --> 30:46.487
I will not let Ganlin Town
run out of salt.

30:47.287 --> 30:50.448
The garrison turning a blind eye
to smuggling is also a grave offense.

30:50.527 --> 30:51.567
Are you aware of that?

30:55.208 --> 30:56.487
If I handle it this way,

30:58.047 --> 30:59.408
I am also easing your burden.

31:01.128 --> 31:03.168
And I will ensure
no third party ever finds out.

31:09.928 --> 31:10.608
Good.

31:13.128 --> 31:13.807
Zhao Ling.

31:14.888 --> 31:17.128
What you think of me does not matter.

31:18.007 --> 31:20.448
What matters
is that the troops have salt.

31:21.487 --> 31:22.848
With morale steady,

31:23.487 --> 31:26.007
the border towns will remain secure.

31:32.208 --> 31:32.968
Mo Yi!

31:36.888 --> 31:37.408
Commander.

31:38.327 --> 31:40.527
Zhao Ling seized warhorses
and has rendered meritorious service.

31:41.567 --> 31:42.968
He is to be appointed
Deputy Battalion Commander.

31:43.648 --> 31:44.767
All benefits

31:45.128 --> 31:46.648
shall be that
of a deputy battalion commander.

31:46.928 --> 31:48.448
Once the external review is completed,

31:48.448 --> 31:49.448
he will be officially promoted.

31:50.688 --> 31:52.727
As for Lu Dahu's death...

31:54.247 --> 31:55.047
General Mo.

31:55.807 --> 31:57.408
You failed to maintain order.

31:57.408 --> 31:58.968
You allowed your concubine
to cause chaos,

31:59.047 --> 32:00.208
to entice a fellow officer's fiancee.

32:01.208 --> 32:02.767
You are relieved of your post
as Commander.

32:03.727 --> 32:05.047
You are demoted to battalion commander.

32:08.608 --> 32:09.688
I accept your command.

32:09.863 --> 32:12.663
(Dadong Temple)

32:12.888 --> 32:14.287
I warned you before.

32:14.408 --> 32:16.327
If you ever crossed me again,

32:17.047 --> 32:18.287
you would die.

32:18.408 --> 32:20.727
I am willing to spend
the rest of my days in prayer.

32:20.727 --> 32:22.327
I beg you to show mercy.

32:27.208 --> 32:28.848
This temple is too small,

32:30.128 --> 32:31.448
and your ambitions are too grand.

32:31.448 --> 32:32.968
It may hold you for a time,

32:33.287 --> 32:35.047
but not for a lifetime.

32:36.208 --> 32:37.168
How about

32:38.168 --> 32:39.727
you return to the Fu family
to recuperate?

32:43.327 --> 32:45.527
I hear there is a family temple there.

32:45.888 --> 32:46.527
It is called...

32:49.767 --> 32:50.928
It is called Biyun Nunnery.

32:53.648 --> 32:54.567
Spare my life, Madam!

32:56.208 --> 32:57.527
Spare my life, Madam!

32:57.527 --> 32:58.527
Please, Madam!

32:58.688 --> 33:00.087
I don't want to go back!

33:00.527 --> 33:01.767
I don't want to go back!

33:02.047 --> 33:03.168
Please, Madam!

33:03.168 --> 33:04.608
Don't send me back!

33:05.567 --> 33:06.128
Madam!

33:06.128 --> 33:07.208
I know I was wrong!

33:07.208 --> 33:08.287
Spare my life, Madam!

33:08.567 --> 33:09.327
Spare my life.

33:10.968 --> 33:11.888
Spare my life, Madam!

33:12.007 --> 33:12.648
Madam!

33:12.648 --> 33:13.247
Madam!

33:13.368 --> 33:14.128
Madam!

33:14.567 --> 33:15.208
Madam!

33:17.487 --> 33:18.688
I'll wait outside.

33:18.928 --> 33:19.648
If you need me,

33:19.968 --> 33:20.688
just call.

33:27.688 --> 33:28.487
Zuo.

33:30.087 --> 33:31.487
There is only one thing
I don't understand.

33:33.448 --> 33:35.128
I have taken the surname Xie.

33:36.287 --> 33:37.848
Why do you still hate me so?

33:38.928 --> 33:40.527
What exactly did I do wrong?

33:46.767 --> 33:48.767
Do you know what an embittered woman is?

33:58.567 --> 33:59.928
An embittered woman

34:00.208 --> 34:02.487
is one who lives

34:02.767 --> 34:04.287
only to resent others.

34:04.888 --> 34:06.128
You did nothing wrong.

34:06.928 --> 34:08.167
You were simply unlucky

34:08.328 --> 34:09.968
to become the object of my hatred.

34:10.808 --> 34:12.087
Clinging to you

34:12.207 --> 34:14.127
is what makes my life interesting.

34:14.207 --> 34:15.848
This is what the Fu family

34:17.647 --> 34:19.007
owes me.

34:22.647 --> 34:24.968
If you had only targeted me alone,

34:26.487 --> 34:27.368
I might have let it be.

34:29.007 --> 34:30.527
But what about the others?

34:31.328 --> 34:33.127
You mistreated the students.

34:33.687 --> 34:35.328
You used Concubine Lu
to stir up trouble.

34:35.408 --> 34:36.567
You even put other girls

34:38.567 --> 34:40.007
at risk in the hall.

34:40.207 --> 34:40.928
So?

34:42.167 --> 34:43.487
Why should they be spared

34:43.647 --> 34:44.928
what I went through?

34:46.047 --> 34:48.007
What you did in Huaying

34:48.928 --> 34:50.928
may have been born
from your own bitter grievances.

34:51.288 --> 34:52.888
But what about what you did in Ganlin?

34:53.007 --> 34:53.808
In the end,

34:55.408 --> 34:57.288
it was all for your selfish desires.

34:57.687 --> 34:59.047
You draped your misery

34:59.047 --> 35:00.328
over your malice like a veil.

35:05.607 --> 35:06.768
How dull.

35:11.928 --> 35:13.928
So you saw through me after all.

35:16.647 --> 35:17.408
Enough.

35:19.487 --> 35:20.768
As for my life,

35:21.848 --> 35:23.808
the first half, I was a chaste widow.

35:25.768 --> 35:27.888
The second, I was a fallen woman.

35:31.728 --> 35:33.167
I've lived as I pleased.

35:36.448 --> 35:38.288
You've been talking to me this long

35:38.888 --> 35:40.928
just for that written confession.

35:42.448 --> 35:43.527
I can give it to you.

35:44.848 --> 35:45.768
Back then,

35:47.248 --> 35:49.768
I did want my brother to marry you.

35:49.888 --> 35:51.047
But that scheme

35:52.448 --> 35:54.448
was Yu Jingxiu's idea.

35:57.487 --> 35:58.687
Why would he do this to me?

35:59.728 --> 36:01.087
He didn't want to marry you.

36:02.848 --> 36:04.328
So he deliberately

36:04.328 --> 36:05.647
sent me a letter

36:06.087 --> 36:07.207
to slander your virtue.

36:07.237 --> 36:08.463
(To Madam Zuo)

36:08.487 --> 36:09.328
For this,

36:10.687 --> 36:13.448
Yu Jingxiu even promised my brother
an official post.

36:14.127 --> 36:15.808
When fortune fell into my lap,

36:17.527 --> 36:19.328
(Framing Fu to break the engagement)
of course I'd seize it.

36:20.687 --> 36:22.808
But words alone wouldn't suffice.

36:23.527 --> 36:25.448
Fortunately, Moxiang

36:25.768 --> 36:26.928
was soft-hearted.

36:27.928 --> 36:28.928
She agreed

36:30.007 --> 36:31.768
to obtain your undergarment.

36:32.368 --> 36:33.328
As for the rest,

36:34.808 --> 36:36.047
you already know.

36:39.047 --> 36:39.607
Thanks.

36:48.970 --> 36:49.610
(Written Confession)

36:49.630 --> 36:50.516
(Yu Jingxiu instigated the coercion
of Fu Tingyun to marry my brother.)

36:50.549 --> 36:51.136
(Signature of Declarant:
Madam Fu, nee Zuo)

36:51.163 --> 36:52.063
(Acting on Zuo's orders,
slandered Fu Tingyun)

36:52.083 --> 36:52.996
(Fabricated charges of secret affairs
against her.)

36:53.016 --> 36:53.776
(Signature of Declarant: Zuo Junjie)

36:53.797 --> 36:55.094
(Having been sworn sisters with Tingyun
for years, she was framed.)

36:55.104 --> 36:55.801
(Signature of Declarant: Fan Yake)

37:01.368 --> 37:02.687
I saw your light was still on.

37:05.087 --> 37:05.808
Still up?

37:10.728 --> 37:12.167
How about we sit outside for a bit?

37:17.607 --> 37:19.248
My grandmother used to say

37:20.527 --> 37:21.527
that for a woman, marriage

37:22.328 --> 37:23.888
is like being born anew.

37:26.167 --> 37:28.248
At first, I only saw
the Zuo family's greed.

37:28.328 --> 37:30.047
I was afraid of being used
as a stepping stone

37:30.408 --> 37:31.487
and falling into the abyss.

37:33.607 --> 37:35.007
Little did I expect that in the end,

37:36.007 --> 37:37.928
it was Mr. Yu who cast me aside.

37:39.607 --> 37:41.248
If he were a man of character,

37:41.768 --> 37:42.848
he should have been straightforward

37:42.848 --> 37:44.167
and told his mother
he didn't want to marry you.

37:45.087 --> 37:46.408
Instead, he plotted and schemed

37:46.808 --> 37:47.647
to destroy your reputation.

37:50.167 --> 37:51.687
He is utterly despicable.

37:53.288 --> 37:54.127
The fault is not yours.

38:00.808 --> 38:02.248
And don't let the past trouble you.

38:06.248 --> 38:07.248
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

38:08.607 --> 38:09.647
At this point,

38:09.968 --> 38:11.848
we finally know who our opponent is.

38:11.848 --> 38:13.448
That's not necessarily a bad thing.

38:15.768 --> 38:16.968
I was just thinking,

38:17.928 --> 38:19.248
the Yu family is powerful.

38:20.248 --> 38:21.687
How are we going to get

38:21.687 --> 38:23.207
the fourth written confession?

38:39.567 --> 38:40.527
Right will prevail over wrong.

38:42.207 --> 38:43.567
No matter how dangerous it is,

38:46.768 --> 38:47.607
I'll be with you.

39:19.968 --> 39:20.487
Sister.

39:22.087 --> 39:22.607
Sister.

39:22.968 --> 39:23.687
Junjie.

39:24.288 --> 39:25.328
Sister, you finally came.

39:25.328 --> 39:26.127
I knew

39:26.127 --> 39:27.527
you wouldn't abandon me.

39:29.687 --> 39:30.047
Sister.

39:30.047 --> 39:30.368
Come on.

39:30.368 --> 39:30.888
Get up.

39:33.368 --> 39:34.448
You must've had a hard time.

39:34.448 --> 39:35.047
Come on.

39:35.647 --> 39:36.207
Get up.

39:36.207 --> 39:37.768
I brought your favorite food.

39:44.928 --> 39:45.567
Sister.

39:47.328 --> 39:48.968
I'll never be an official now.

39:48.968 --> 39:50.647
I have nothing left.

39:51.167 --> 39:52.768
All I have is you.

39:54.728 --> 39:55.527
Don't be afraid.

39:55.888 --> 39:57.768
I've already made all the arrangements.

39:58.408 --> 39:59.328
Tonight,

39:59.647 --> 40:01.087
someone will come to take you away.

40:03.487 --> 40:04.007
Here.

40:04.768 --> 40:05.487
Don't choke.

40:06.968 --> 40:07.448
Sister.

40:16.687 --> 40:17.487
Junjie.

40:20.288 --> 40:21.487
You've been through so much.

40:43.207 --> 40:44.207
It hurts so much.

40:47.250 --> 40:50.350
(Dadong Temple)

41:04.408 --> 41:05.888
It took me so much

41:06.487 --> 41:08.768
to crawl out of the Fu family
in Huaying.

41:10.728 --> 41:13.288
I don't want to go back
to that gloomy place anymore.

41:15.647 --> 41:17.368
This memorial arch,

41:18.687 --> 41:19.888
whoever wants it

41:20.607 --> 41:22.448
can guard it themselves.

41:23.768 --> 41:25.808
I've spent my whole life
merely existing.

41:28.328 --> 41:30.087
Now it's time to truly live.

41:56.210 --> 41:58.850
(Next Episode)

41:59.248 --> 42:00.687
Jin Yuanbao sent word.

42:00.968 --> 42:02.968
(Yu Jingxiu, Compiler)
After Yu Jingxiu became the top scholar,

42:02.968 --> 42:03.968
he entered the Hanlin Academy

42:04.368 --> 42:05.848
and became a compiler.

42:06.368 --> 42:07.728
What does it have to do
with the external review?

42:08.527 --> 42:10.127
His showing up in Ganlin Town now

42:10.408 --> 42:11.968
probably means he's up to no good.

42:12.728 --> 42:14.527
Ganlin Town is like a swamp.

42:15.328 --> 42:17.728
You have to walk over corpses
to carve a path forward.

42:17.728 --> 42:19.288
Ten lifetimes won't be enough
to get ahead.

42:20.087 --> 42:20.687
(Coincidentally,)

42:21.487 --> 42:22.888
(you've run right into me.)

42:23.567 --> 42:24.487
(Want to turn things around?)

42:25.487 --> 42:26.288
(That's a bit difficult.)

42:28.047 --> 42:29.647
You hypocrite.

42:42.881 --> 42:47.201
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

42:50.801 --> 42:55.161
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

42:57.281 --> 43:01.921
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

43:02.161 --> 43:04.961
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

43:06.121 --> 43:10.761
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

43:13.961 --> 43:20.801
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

43:21.681 --> 43:28.201
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

43:29.161 --> 43:32.601
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:33.121 --> 43:37.321
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:37.601 --> 43:43.281
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

43:55.401 --> 43:59.281
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

44:03.201 --> 44:07.201
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

44:08.921 --> 44:13.601
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

44:13.921 --> 44:16.601
♪Kept close within my heart♪

44:17.681 --> 44:22.521
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

44:26.041 --> 44:32.961
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

44:33.841 --> 44:40.321
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

44:41.201 --> 44:44.721
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

44:45.161 --> 44:49.521
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

44:49.721 --> 44:55.441
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
